{"episodes":{"165843":"Showers and thunderstorms developed along and ahead of an evening cold front and produced a weak tornado and some hail.","167240":"Strong to severe thunderstorms, which developed along a dryline and a Pacific cold front, affected areas mainly along and east of the Interstate 35 corridor during the afternoon and evening of Monday, March 14. Hail was the most frequent severe weather occurrence with these storms, but there was one confirmed tornado in Fannin County."},"events":[{"begin":"2022-03-14T22:15Z","county":"Mclennan","damageCrops":"0.00K","damageProperty":"0.00K","deaths":0,"end":"2022-03-14T22:15Z","endLat":31.73,"endLon":-97.1,"episode":167240,"id":1012282,"injuries":0,"lat":31.73,"location":"0.69 N Drew","lon":-97.1,"magnitude":0.88,"narrative":"Broadcast media reported nickel sized hail in the city of Ross, TX.","source":"Broadcast Media","state":"TX","type":"Hail","wfo":"FWD"},{"begin":"2022-03-14T22:20Z","county":"Ellis","damageCrops":"0.00K","damageProperty":"0.00K","deaths":0,"end":"2022-03-14T22:20Z","endLat":32.43,"endLon":-96.86,"episode":167240,"id":1012283,"injuries":0,"lat":32.43,"location":"1.5 SSW Service","lon":-96.86,"magnitude":1.0,"narrative":"A trained spotter reported quarter sized hail in Waxahachie, TX.","source":"Trained Spotter","state":"TX","type":"Hail","wfo":"FWD"},{"begin":"2022-03-14T22:24Z","county":"Dallas","damageCrops":"0.00K","damageProperty":"0.00K","deaths":0,"end":"2022-03-14T22:24Z","endLat":32.82,"endLon":-96.81,"episode":167240,"id":1012284,"injuries":0,"lat":32.82,"location":"2.32 W Highland Park","lon":-96.81,"magnitude":1.0,"narrative":"A public report indicated quarter sized hail near the Highland Park area of Dallas, TX.","source":"Public","state":"TX","type":"Hail","wfo":"FWD"},{"begin":"2022-03-14T22:27Z","county":"Mclennan","damageCrops":"0.00K","damageProperty":"0.00K","deaths":0,"end":"2022-03-14T22:27Z","endLat":31.8,"endLon":-97.09,"episode":167240,"id":1012285,"injuries":0,"lat":31.8